/* Test that yylineno counts newlines matched by the default rule.
 * Only words have a rule of their own, so every digit, space,
 * punctuation mark and newline in the input is matched by the
 * default rule. The input has six newlines, so yylineno is 7 at EOF.
 * See https://github.com/westes/flex/issues/397.
 */
%option 8bit
%option nounput nomain noyywrap noinput yylineno
%option warn

WORD [[:alpha:]]+

%%
{WORD}
<<EOF>>  {M4_TEST_ASSERT(yylineno == 7) M4_TEST_DO(yyterminate())}

###
Only words
have rules. 1 2 3
+-*/


The end
